00:23:39,244 --> 00:23:42,284
Utau you ni,
And voices of singing

252
00:23:42,284 --> 00:23:48,384
Hibiku kaze no oto
Echoing voices of the wind

253
00:23:48,524 --> 00:23:55,034
Yorokobi, kanashimi,
In happiness and in sadness,

254
00:23:55,034 --> 00:24:01,634
Subete idaite aruiteiru,
In all I behold and all that I live for,

255
00:24:01,634 --> 00:24:05,404
Watashi no te to
With my hand in your hand

256
00:24:05,404 --> 00:24:08,474
Kimi no te wo
And your hand in my hand,

257
00:24:08,474 --> 00:24:15,504
Tsuyoku tsunagu mono
Together, we are one and whole

258
00:24:24,294 --> 00:24:30,754
The End

